WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
I'll gather some supplies for you to buy a new house in the city.

2
00:00:12,940 --> 00:00:14,820
Come in, I'll get you something to eat

3
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:18,040
Did you see anyone else

4
00:00:20,060 --> 00:00:21,180
If you don’t tell me, I won’t go in.

5
00:00:25,170 --> 00:00:27,610
You can go out to play after eating

6
00:00:28,010 --> 00:00:29,690
Captain Beauty, what do you say now?

7
00:00:32,430 --> 00:00:33,990
Follow him first and say more clichés

8
00:00:34,310 --> 00:00:35,550
Where to find Shaoyang and the others?

9
00:00:36,850 --> 00:00:39,410
There is your favorite canned food. Eat it quickly.

10
00:00:41,880 --> 00:00:43,860
Mom, I'm not hungry now
